{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT FOR YOUR FREEDOM!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the arena, a chaotic free-for-all battle where the last penguin standing is considered the champion. Arm yourself with different weapons and defend yourself with different types of armory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/28977519b27cce04ecf9a66fd51feeb2.poster.avif?t=1762695207\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/28977519b27cce04ecf9a66fd51feeb2.webm?t=1762695207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/28977519b27cce04ecf9a66fd51feeb2.mp4?t=1762695207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLE YOUR WAY THROUGH DIFFERENT ARENAS!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face tougher opponents as you climb the ranks of the gladiator pits.\u00a0Defeat them all and earn your opportunity to face the <strong>Penguin Master</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/bea80e3e250017571d23671ed7924414.poster.avif?t=1762695207\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/bea80e3e250017571d23671ed7924414.webm?t=1762695207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/bea80e3e250017571d23671ed7924414.mp4?t=1762695207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE AND WIN!\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through 20 different arenas with random opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the gladiator ladder, facing stronger rivals as you rise toward the Penguin Master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself with the strongest weapon and armory you can have.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your combat stats with 15+ different enchantments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, you're a gladiator. Everything you've built over the course of your journey will be lost if you DIE.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/293b8a7f833ae17fb4cec524fde858a9.poster.avif?t=1762695207\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/293b8a7f833ae17fb4cec524fde858a9.webm?t=1762695207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/293b8a7f833ae17fb4cec524fde858a9.mp4?t=1762695207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight. Survive. Win your freedom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3700690?t=1762695207","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3700690?t=1762695207","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/e9336ee1ed9dd1cb1951cf88b60bd8d50689cb9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762695207","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/e9336ee1ed9dd1cb1951cf88b60bd8d50689cb9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762695207","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"descriptio